WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.200
Open Case Studio. Every prompt and visual change stays in one authoring record.

00:03.200 --> 00:06.400
Add evidence, connect it to a decision, and rename an actor in one iterative prompt.

00:06.400 --> 00:09.600
Review the deterministic operation plan before applying any graph changes.

00:09.600 --> 00:12.800
Apply the plan as one transaction. Inspect its exact diff or undo it.

00:12.800 --> 00:16.000
The graph, node inspector, and prompt history now describe the same case state.

00:16.000 --> 00:19.200
Add, rename, and connect a node directly in the visual editor.

00:19.200 --> 00:22.400
Relink an existing relationship without rebuilding the case.

00:22.400 --> 00:26.200
Compile the current graph and launch it in the full case player.
